Q("Stock is best framed to owners as:", ["Goods on shelves", "Capital wearing inventory's clothes — every stock decision is a capital-allocation decision", "A necessary evil", "The warehouse's business"], 1, "The framing converts warehouse reports into money reports.", "Ch1"),
